# Development workflow rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` and applicable rules/docs before architectural changes.
- Implement only the requested phase/scope; do not silently begin future roadmap items.
- Preserve working code and historical migrations unless explicitly instructed otherwise.
- For schema changes create new versioned migrations; do not rewrite applied migrations.
- When a decision changes architecture/security/product behavior, update the relevant docs/ADR.
- Before phase completion run lint, typecheck, tests/integration tests and build as applicable.
- Report what was actually executed vs not executable in the environment.
- List technical debt/security limitations explicitly; do not mark incomplete work complete.
